WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.721
By the end of the module you should be able to
structure multi-step SQL with

00:00:03.747 --> 00:00:09.458
CTEs trace a recursive query choose the correct
ranking function analyze sequences with LAG

00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:15.340
and LEAD and write explicit frames for running and
moving calculations You

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:21.135
should also understand the difference between GROUP
BY and PARTITION BY The goal

00:00:21.148 --> 00:00:25.795
is not only to run the syntax You should be able to
explain the row

00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:27.190
meaning at every stage
